Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.08,0:00:07.89,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I WANT TO CHANGE THE WORLD　源源不绝的热情{\fad(500,00)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.98,0:00:12.98,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向着怦然心动的未来  伸出双手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:19.29,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定能够放出光芒　IT'S WONDERLAND
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:25.11,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,未来那无法预测的黑夜  震撼着你的心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.23,0:00:32.91,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法相信任何东西  你充耳不闻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.61,0:00:40.53,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与你相遇的瞬间  我找到了真正的归宿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.03,0:00:49.20,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不自觉的温柔呈现在面前  把我们唤醒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.64,0:00:56.26,OP2,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I WANT TO CHANGE THE WORLD　不会再迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.26,0:01:06.00,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要构筑起跟你在一起的未来  就能飞向任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:11.14,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,CHANGE MY MIND　源源不绝的热情
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.43,0:01:16.22,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向着未知的明天  张开双翼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.22,0:01:23.00,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定能够展翅飞翔　IT'S WONDERLAND{\fad(0000,480)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.70,0:22:25.36,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一味地  只知道逞强的我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.03,0:22:32.86,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  从那时起我不再茫然
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.87,0:22:40.45,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定有想要与你分享的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.61,0:22:48.72,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也有许多想向你倾诉的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.92,0:22:55.73,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论是笑容还是泪颜都想呈现给你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.73,0:22:59.83,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等待着  将曾经放弃的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.83,0:23:03.63,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,机会重新抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.04,0:23:10.72,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想着你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.94,0:23:18.75,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要如此  便觉得心变得坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.15,0:23:25.86,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这份渺茫的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.36,0:23:30.03,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论何时都在祈祷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.33,0:23:35.31,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能够传达给你…{\fad(0000,1310)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.99,0:01:42.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然飞天少爷真的很迷人 不过满天少爷才是最帅的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.86,0:01:45.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是他的黑发太迷人了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.80,0:01:48.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然只要有头发的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.87,0:01:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就可以跟飞天哥哥一样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.74,0:01:52.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受到这么多女人的欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.79,0:02:00.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.23,0:02:00.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.58,0:02:04.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.88,0:02:06.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.05,0:02:08.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是有头发就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.72,0:02:10.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是有头发就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.96,0:02:19.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从思春期开始
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.10,0:02:22.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就一直做着类似这样的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.27,0:02:24.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我也有一头浓密的头发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.94,0:02:27.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不见得比得上飞天哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.67,0:02:31.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得自己的外型也还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.68,0:02:34.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好希望有一天能像飞天哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.15,0:02:37.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一头浓密的长发 受到女人欢迎啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.09,0:02:43.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狩猎啦 满天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.69,0:02:46.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的 飞天哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.06,0:02:48.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雷击刃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.97,0:02:56.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后用这招了结你们！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.00,0:03:02.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要瞄准那里应该可以打倒他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.18,0:03:08.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.65,0:03:12.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的头发…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.58,0:03:15.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶！！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.49,0:03:16.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.59,0:03:18.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你身上有四魂之玉的碎片这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.79,0:03:20.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.46,0:03:24.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我就把你给杀了 然后再把它抢过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.56,0:03:28.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才要你的四魂之玉的碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.80,0:03:36.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看你能承受我的雷击到什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.15,0:03:45.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好像只有蛮力嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.72,0:03:48.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我就好好陪你玩一玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.15,0:03:52.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个雷兽小子 不太好对付…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.62,0:03:57.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖刀激战！雷击刃VS铁碎牙！！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.12,0:04:04.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子 看样子你是我值得一战的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.59,0:04:07.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可要好好陪我玩哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.39,0:04:09.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过去对我说这种大话的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.39,0:04:12.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从来没有一个到最后还觉得好玩的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.66,0:04:14.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那正好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.26,0:04:17.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就好好尝一尝我雷击刃的滋味吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.30,0:04:23.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.57,0:04:26.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不接好的话 可是会死哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.24,0:04:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞天的雷击刃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.64,0:04:32.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果被砍到的话 恐怕连我也受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.65,0:04:35.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 飞天就交给你来解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.02,0:04:37.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇就由我来救她
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.52,0:04:39.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.39,0:04:43.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油啊 飞天哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.39,0:04:45.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我助你一臂之力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.59,0:04:47.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个打一个 真是太卑鄙了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.17,0:04:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.68,0:05:03.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.61,0:05:07.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不是担心女人的时候吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.42,0:05:10.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.55,0:05:12.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我救你之前 你自己要加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.92,0:05:16.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这种情况下你叫我怎么加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.79,0:05:19.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛好痛 不过幸好得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.56,0:05:21.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个臭丫头…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.50,0:05:22.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.86,0:05:24.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.37,0:05:34.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狐妖术 雷霆万钧陀螺！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.32,0:05:44.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 快来这边
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.02,0:05:46.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.39,0:05:49.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 没有想到你还有这么厉害的招术
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.89,0:05:51.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.46,0:05:54.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在安心还太早了点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.10,0:05:55.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.40,0:05:58.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狐妖术只是障眼法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.53,0:06:00.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,障眼法？这么说那只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.90,0:06:02.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛痛痛痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.67,0:06:04.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过是幻影罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.74,0:06:11.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死 那只可恶的小狐狸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.78,0:06:18.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.19,0:06:20.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有了 没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.55,0:06:23.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的头发！！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.13,0:06:28.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟敢把我的最后一根头发给…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.94,0:06:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像火上浇油了啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.57,0:06:38.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.81,0:06:42.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在…哪…里…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.71,0:06:46.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生发剂还有该死的小狐狸…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.88,0:06:50.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑到什么地方去了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.22,0:06:52.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎…怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.09,0:06:54.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被他发现的话只有死路一条的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.16,0:06:55.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 那支箭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.02,0:06:57.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定还可以派上用场
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.03,0:06:59.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.23,0:07:04.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那里吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.41,0:07:14.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个臭丫头
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.61,0:07:17.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为逃得出我的手掌心吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.98,0:07:21.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗唆 你这个光溜溜的大秃头
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.32,0:07:22.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.05,0:07:25.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看吧 这就是你最喜欢的头发
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:28.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有两个臭丫头
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.82,0:07:32.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的箭…快点还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.36,0:07:33.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是…小狐狸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.99,0:07:36.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要替我爸爸报仇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.50,0:07:39.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 你就像这样子缠住他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.57,0:07:42.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要撬出他额头上的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.94,0:07:44.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能打倒他！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.77,0:07:48.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.65,0:07:55.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要把你给掐死…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.15,0:07:58.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬…犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.15,0:08:01.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.09,0:08:05.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你分什么神啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.53,0:08:15.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你也只会说大话而已
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.40,0:08:18.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来还以为你能陪我玩久一点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.24,0:08:19.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吓破胆了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:23.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来慢慢折磨你 先砍断你的手脚来玩好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.24,0:08:25.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法专心跟他斗…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.31,0:08:27.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是要先解决戈薇那边
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.62,0:08:28.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看啊 满天
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.05,0:08:32.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个半妖小子吓到站不起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.49,0:08:35.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这边也很好玩哦 飞天哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.76,0:08:38.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.29,0:08:40.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这临死的女人的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.66,0:08:42.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.76,0:08:43.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.03,0:08:45.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚开！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.64,0:08:53.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很不甘心吧 你这只臭小狐狸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.74,0:08:55.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等着吧 等我杀了这个女人之后
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.91,0:08:58.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就来剥你的毛皮了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.61,0:09:00.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像你老爸一样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.18,0:09:05.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的毛皮就拿来做头巾好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.62,0:09:09.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就让你们父子的毛皮在我的身上团聚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.69,0:09:10.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满天
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.93,0:09:14.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也变得这么会说话了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.03,0:09:17.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥夸奖我了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.80,0:09:21.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝饶不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.77,0:09:25.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.54,0:09:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我死也不会放开的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.81,0:09:30.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个臭小子 给我放开
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.78,0:09:33.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开 可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.31,0:09:37.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你再不放开的话 我就把你的头骨打碎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.05,0:09:40.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满天
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.22,0:09:43.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心点别让血弄脏了毛皮哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.32,0:09:44.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样就做不了头巾了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.83,0:09:46.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.06,0:09:50.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.97,0:09:53.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我也不是什么好人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.97,0:09:56.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过你们更烂得叫人恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.67,0:09:58.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞刃血爪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.34,0:10:02.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有意思 再多抵抗点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.98,0:10:11.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 你往什么地方丢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.22,0:10:12.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.89,0:10:19.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满…满天！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.00,0:10:23.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.23,0:10:25.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.23,0:10:26.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得拿给犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.63,0:10:28.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.77,0:10:31.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了…还有七宝爸爸的毛皮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.91,0:10:32.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满天
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.01,0:10:36.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 快点离开那个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.51,0:10:37.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.52,0:10:42.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满天
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.49,0:10:46.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞天哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.25,0:10:49.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的头发都没有了…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.12,0:10:51.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不想活了…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.76,0:10:53.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在胡说什么 满天
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.49,0:10:55.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要挺住！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.43,0:10:57.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞天哥哥你的头发…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.26,0:10:59.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟老爸的一模一样…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.40,0:11:03.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好希望自己能长得像老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.17,0:11:05.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老妈能要是能漂亮一点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.04,0:11:09.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者头上的头发多一点也好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.28,0:11:10.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.28,0:11:14.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爸到底看上老妈哪一点要跟她结婚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.55,0:11:16.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞天哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.55,0:11:18.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外表长什么样子并不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.75,0:11:21.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我唯一最心爱的弟弟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.06,0:11:24.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 飞天哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.66,0:11:26.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经想过下辈子投胎的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.53,0:11:29.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己能够变成毛毛虫也不错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.76,0:11:32.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为全身都有毛茸茸的毛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.20,0:11:33.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过现在我不想了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.83,0:11:35.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下辈子投胎的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.77,0:11:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算我的头上还是没有头发
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.81,0:11:41.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是希望能够当飞天哥哥你的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.58,0:11:43.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以吗 哥哥…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.45,0:11:47.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满天 喂 满天
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.22,0:11:51.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你还活着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.22,0:11:53.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.69,0:11:55.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有把铁碎牙拿回来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.66,0:11:57.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是为了那把刀拖拖拉拉的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.96,0:12:00.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 你还救了我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.46,0:12:02.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你少担心那些有的没有的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.73,0:12:07.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算没有刀我也不会输给那个家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.74,0:12:08.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满天…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.94,0:12:15.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满天他死了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.51,0:12:17.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可怜的弟弟…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.98,0:12:22.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥永远都会跟你在一起的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.46,0:12:30.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他…他在吃他的弟弟吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.72,0:12:33.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.36,0:12:34.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞天这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.50,0:12:36.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是把满天额头上的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.70,0:12:38.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吸进自己的体内
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.97,0:12:41.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉少爷 你要特别小心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.37,0:12:45.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙已经有5个四魂碎片的力量了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.84,0:12:47.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先别说这些 冥加爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.88,0:12:50.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚又溜到哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.51,0:12:53.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正还不是逃到安全的地方去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:56.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次都等到安全的时候才肯出来露个面
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.65,0:12:59.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总有一天我要揍扁你！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.62,0:13:01.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要计较这点芝麻绿豆的事嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.76,0:13:04.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,危险
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.53,0:13:13.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们然敢杀死我最心爱的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.87,0:13:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对饶不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.01,0:13:22.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雷击刃的威力又增强了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.64,0:13:26.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,5个四魂碎片的力量真不是盖的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.28,0:13:29.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你带着七宝走能逃多远就逃多远
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.92,0:13:30.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.77,0:13:31.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.16,0:13:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀弟之仇 我非报不可
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.57,0:13:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太大了 根本躲不开
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.41,0:13:58.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉少爷 用铁碎牙的刀鞘吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.21,0:13:59.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙的刀鞘？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.68,0:14:02.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定能抵挡雷击的 快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.98,0:14:04.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.49,0:14:10.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.31,0:14:28.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.98,0:14:30.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜的果然没错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.58,0:14:33.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能收纳妖刀铁碎牙的刀鞘
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.38,0:14:36.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照理说也应该可以抵挡得了雷兽的妖力才对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.25,0:14:40.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸好我的猜测没错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.62,0:14:42.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你果然是乱说的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.09,0:14:46.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之我刚才差点因为跑得太慢而死在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.26,0:14:48.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好不容易才捡回这条命
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.16,0:14:49.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看我们还是快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.73,0:14:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑 我就要用这个来对付他
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.40,0:14:56.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你的命！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.77,0:15:01.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要能近他的身 就能打倒他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.11,0:15:07.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要近谁的身啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.52,0:15:12.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.92,0:15:17.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是爸爸的毛皮…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.29,0:15:19.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 你醒了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.29,0:15:22.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 满天他怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.13,0:15:24.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满天已经被犬夜叉杀掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.30,0:15:25.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是飞天变得更强了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.67,0:15:29.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算不把你烧成黑炭也要把你剁成肉酱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.81,0:15:35.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉陷入苦战了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.64,0:15:39.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是因为飞天可以自在地飞来飞去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.28,0:15:41.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞天的风火轮？对了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.79,0:15:49.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为四魂之玉的碎片 他的移动速度快了好多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.69,0:15:53.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是有弓就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.19,0:15:54.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.66,0:15:58.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我不报恩的话 我爸一定会很生气的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.23,0:16:02.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊 七宝可以变成弓
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.24,0:16:06.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是蜗牛吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.57,0:16:07.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是弓
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.08,0:16:15.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.58,0:16:16.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点把箭射出去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.95,0:16:18.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的箭只剩这一支
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.09,0:16:20.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我射得不太准…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.99,0:16:23.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也会助你一臂之力的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.49,0:16:25.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.60,0:16:29.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.37,0:16:33.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,射中了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.94,0:16:37.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趁现在
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.47,0:16:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是傻瓜吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.11,0:16:40.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太乱来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.61,0:16:43.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算犬夜叉少爷的身体很耐打
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.14,0:16:46.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直接握着雷击刃能做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.98,0:16:50.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冥加爷爷 你什么时候跑过来的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.12,0:16:52.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点放手啊 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.02,0:16:55.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个刀鞘真碍事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.72,0:17:00.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个大笨蛋 谁叫你扔掉刀鞘了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.13,0:17:03.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样才能够放手一搏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.07,0:17:12.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道我的厉害了吧 你这个大额头！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.61,0:17:14.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打…打飞了…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.61,0:17:16.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然很简单 可是好厉害…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.58,0:17:18.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不愧是犬夜叉少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.61,0:17:20.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是想用体力来一决胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.15,0:17:22.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样 快点揍扁他
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.92,0:17:25.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才不是才骂他大笨蛋吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.99,0:17:36.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脸被打中
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.26,0:17:38.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可是我生平第一次呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.43,0:17:40.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在发热
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.47,0:17:42.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好强的热气
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.91,0:17:48.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你完蛋了 臭小子！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.25,0:17:57.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀鞘裂开了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.89,0:18:03.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个半妖臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.66,0:18:05.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真干了不少好事啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.96,0:18:09.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了 万一刀鞘的结界被破坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.43,0:18:11.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算犬夜叉少爷身体再结实也…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.70,0:18:13.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没希望了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.10,0:18:18.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要把铁碎牙拿给犬夜叉才行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.54,0:18:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 让我来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.97,0:18:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 不行 你现在过去太危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.41,0:18:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.98,0:18:28.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是满天的雷击波？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.98,0:18:30.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想用他弟弟的绝招？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.98,0:18:33.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,危险 快逃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.79,0:18:40.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.23,0:18:41.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼 活该
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.03,0:18:44.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.30,0:18:48.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人跟那个小鬼都死了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.24,0:18:50.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.74,0:18:52.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我饶不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.01,0:18:57.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.74,0:18:58.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明只是半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.91,0:19:02.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然比那些下等妖怪还要顽强难缠
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.22,0:19:05.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在打倒你之前我是绝对不会死的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.95,0:19:08.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的女人被杀就气昏头了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.02,0:19:11.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少为了这种无聊的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.26,0:19:13.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我罗罗嗦嗦的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.09,0:19:14.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弟弟被杀掉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.26,0:19:16.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这个做哥哥的心里有多难过
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.86,0:19:19.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要让你彻底知道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.87,0:19:22.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊…要断了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.80,0:19:26.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.38,0:19:35.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.62,0:19:38.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀鞘唤来了刀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.45,0:19:40.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.56,0:19:48.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我居然输了…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.73,0:19:50.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,输给了该死的半妖…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.06,0:19:53.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…我竟然会…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.61,0:20:05.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉少爷 是四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.01,0:20:07.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.65,0:20:11.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是我能够快点打倒飞天的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.55,0:20:14.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.65,0:20:15.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.99,0:20:21.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…谢谢你帮我很多忙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.33,0:20:24.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是 能报杀父之仇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.10,0:20:26.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很高兴…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.33,0:20:28.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那应该是他们两个人的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.84,0:20:30.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想来跟你做最后的道别吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.64,0:20:31.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.07,0:20:34.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 别走
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.62,0:20:43.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.09,0:20:47.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.69,0:20:50.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还活着？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.36,0:20:52.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫我别去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.76,0:20:59.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸 是你用狐火保护了我们吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.20,0:21:05.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如我所见的 那是从毛皮发出来的狐火
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.87,0:21:08.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才明明说是他们的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.58,0:21:11.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才是刚才 现在是现在
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.28,0:21:12.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.05,0:21:16.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们别老说些让人误会的话啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.72,0:21:19.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死了就说死了 没有死就说没有死
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.32,0:21:20.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分清楚点行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.16,0:21:28.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 犬夜叉 你怎么了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.90,0:21:31.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在生什么气嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.70,0:21:34.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为犬夜叉少爷刚才太激动搞错了状况
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.13,0:21:35.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害他现在恼羞成怒了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.50,0:21:38.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉少爷果然还是很孩子气
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.01,0:21:44.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 七宝 你该回去了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.74,0:21:47.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛啊 我就不能跟着你们吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.98,0:21:49.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么关系嘛 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.68,0:21:51.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝一个人孤孤单单的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.89,0:21:56.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 没错 我也是个弱小的孩子哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.42,0:21:59.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就会在这个时候装出小孩的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.63,0:22:02.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 你什么时候才肯滚回去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.53,0:22:05.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇…他欺负我！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.20,0:22:07.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你不要太过份了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.50,0:22:08.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.40,0:22:10.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还像是个小孩一样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.18,0:23:51.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我所居住的日暮神社是十分古老的神社
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.09,0:23:54.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我一直不太相信爷爷的祈祷跟咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.59,0:23:57.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是从古井可以连接到战国时代来看
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.96,0:23:59.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里果然相当古老
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.96,0:24:03.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且以前就做过不少驱妖除魔的委托
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.20,0:24:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神社收纳的能面烧掉了封印它的符咒
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.07,0:24:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且攻击我们
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.07,0:24:12.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉 在现代复活的诅咒能面
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.17,0:24:13.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬请期待
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.55,0:24:19.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉宝典
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.00,0:24:27.05,KEYPOINT,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(357,290)}七宝的杀父仇人 哥哥飞天使用雷击刃
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.00,0:24:27.05,KEYPOINT,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(266,437}弟弟满天吐出\N雷击波
